    "title": "ElizaOS Community Discussion - July 11, 2026",
    "content": [
      {
        "text": "A community member shared that the Ruby Trivia app, tagged under web3, gaming, elizaos, crypto, and memecoin categories, is now officially live on Amazon. The app was announced via a Farcaster post by user Magicyte.",
        "sources": "https://discord.com/channels/1253563208833433701/1253563209462448241",
        "images": "https://cdn.elizaos.news/elizaos-media/original_a1ee4fde.jpg"
      },
      {
        "text": "A community member noted that ERC-8004, a standard for agent verification and reputation, was implemented about a month ago. They observed that someone appears to have ported the structure over to Solana in a project called HANKO by hanko-labs, described as a Solana agent trust registry with bond and slash mechanics. The member asked for confirmation from more knowledgeable community members. A bot attempted to analyze the repository but failed. The GitHub repository can be found at https://github.com/hanko-labs/hanko.",
        "sources": "https://discord.com/channels/1253563208833433701/1253563209462448241",
        "images": "https://cdn.elizaos.news/elizaos-media/hanko_097072c6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "text": "In the coders channel, Odilitime briefly commented that certain tools or features can be used for anything, though the specific context of the conversation was not fully captured in the available data.",
        "sources": "https://discord.com/channels/1253563208833433701/1300025221834739744",
        "posters": "https://cdn.elizaos.news/posters/1783819576607-w9bdi.jpg"
      }
    ],
